{
  "_comment": [
    "Upstream CustomResourceDefinitions this repository validates against, pinned by",
    "release tag AND content checksum. The tag alone is not a pin: a tag can be moved,",
    "and a schema that silently changes turns manifest validation into a formality.",
    "k8s/schemas/refresh.sh verifies every checksum before it regenerates anything and",
    "refuses on a mismatch. Bumping a pin means changing the version AND the sha256 in",
    "the same edit, which is what makes the change reviewable.",
    "Recorded 2026-07-28."
  ],
